{"id":"dtmf-dob-keyed-in-two-parts","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"A date of birth keyed in two parts within one answer window: 0101, then 80#. The parts join.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"Please enter your date of birth as m m d d y y, then press pound.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":4000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"0101","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":5000,"endMs":6000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"80#","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":8000,"endMs":8500}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"endTurn":2,"class":"dob","start":0,"end":2,"via":"prompt","confidence":"high"}]}
{"id":"dtmf-card-keyed-in-two-parts","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"A card keyed in two parts after the card prompt: one value, prompted, high.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"Please enter your credit card number, then press pound.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":4000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"4539148803","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":5000,"endMs":7000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"436467#","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":9000,"endMs":10000}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"endTurn":2,"class":"card","start":0,"end":6,"via":"prompt","confidence":"high"}]}
{"id":"dtmf-never-joins-across-a-bot-turn","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"Keypad parts never join across a bot turn, even a backchannel: the 80# after mm-hmm stands alone.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"Please enter your date of birth as m m d d y y, then press pound.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":4000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"0101","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":5000,"endMs":6000},{"speaker":"bot","text":"Mm-hmm.","channel":"speech","beginMs":6500,"endMs":7000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"80#","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":8000,"endMs":8500}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"class":"dob","start":0,"end":4,"via":"prompt","confidence":"low"}]}
{"id":"dtmf-part-never-joins-speech-across-a-bot-turn","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"A spoken part and a keypad part with a bot turn between them do not join: the keypad part has its own answer window.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"Please enter your date of birth as m m d d y y, then press pound.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":4000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"oh one oh one","channel":"speech","beginMs":5000,"endMs":6500},{"speaker":"bot","text":"Mm-hmm.","channel":"speech","beginMs":7000,"endMs":7500},{"speaker":"customer","text":"80#","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":8000,"endMs":8500}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"class":"dob","start":0,"end":4,"via":"prompt","confidence":"low"}]}
{"id":"menu-turn-ends-pending-dob-keyed","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"Stugum's case: an incomplete keyed DOB, then a menu turn, then 1 pressed within 15 s. The 1 answers the menu; it is not part of the DOB.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"Please enter your date of birth as m m d d y y, then press pound.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":4000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"0230#","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":5000,"endMs":6000},{"speaker":"bot","text":"Thanks. Reply 1 for more.","channel":"speech","beginMs":6500,"endMs":8000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"1","channel":"dtmf","beginMs":9000,"endMs":9200}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"class":"dob","start":0,"end":4,"via":"prompt","confidence":"low"}]}
{"id":"menu-turn-ends-pending-dob-spoken","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"The same with speech: a menu turn is not a backchannel, so the spoken 1 does not join the DOB.","turns":[{"speaker":"bot","text":"What is your date of birth?","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":3000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"oh two three oh","channel":"speech","beginMs":3500,"endMs":5000},{"speaker":"bot","text":"Thanks. Reply 1 for more.","channel":"speech","beginMs":5500,"endMs":7000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"one","channel":"speech","beginMs":8000,"endMs":8300}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"class":"dob","start":0,"end":4,"via":"prompt","confidence":"low"}]}
{"id":"question-turn-ends-pending-card","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"An agent question between two halves of a card ends the first half: prompted low, and the second half alone is nothing.","turns":[{"speaker":"agent","text":"What's your card number?","channel":"chat","beginMs":0},{"speaker":"customer","text":"4539 1488","channel":"chat","beginMs":5000},{"speaker":"agent","text":"Is that a Visa?","channel":"chat","beginMs":8000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"0343 6467","channel":"chat","beginMs":11000}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"class":"card","start":0,"end":8,"via":"prompt","confidence":"low"}]}
{"id":"backchannel-still-joins-speech","source":"txp-labs/sensitive-data-scanner#15","description":"A backchannel that is neither a menu nor a question still lets a spoken value continue.","turns":[{"speaker":"agent","text":"Card number, please.","channel":"speech","beginMs":0,"endMs":2000},{"speaker":"customer","text":"4539 1488","channel":"speech","beginMs":2500,"endMs":4500},{"speaker":"agent","text":"Okay.","channel":"speech","beginMs":5000,"endMs":5500},{"speaker":"customer","text":"0343 6467","channel":"speech","beginMs":6000,"endMs":8000}],"expect":[{"turn":1,"endTurn":3,"class":"card","start":0,"end":8,"via":"prompt","confidence":"high"}]}
